---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout noindex
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for Best Shanghai Restaurants — the rules for using this site, our content, and disclaimers about restaurant information and third-party links."
>
  <main>
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none font-semibold text-slate-900">Terms of Use</h1>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing and using Best Shanghai Restaurants (this site), you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Use of Content</h2>
          <p>All text, images, and guides on this site are provided for general informational purposes. You may share links to our pages, but you may not republish, scrape, or commercially reproduce our content without prior written permission.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>Restaurant details such as prices, opening hours, menus, and availability change frequently. We work to keep information current, but we cannot guarantee it is always accurate. Always confirm key details directly with a restaurant before visiting.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>This site links to external resources such as reservation platforms and reference sources. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of third-party websites.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>This site is provided “as is.” We are not liable for any losses or damages arising from your use of the information published here.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@shanghai-restaurant.com" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 break-all">hello@shanghai-restaurant.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
